# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All variables are OPTIONAL. The site runs, builds and deploys without any of
# them — the contact form and GitHub graph degrade gracefully and say so.
# Copy to .env.local for development, or set them in your host's dashboard.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Canonical origin used by metadata, sitemap, robots, RSS and the résumé.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://arifrahman.dev

# --- Contact inbox -----------------------------------------------------------
# Postgres (preferred). The Drizzle schema is in src/db/schema.ts.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# ...or forward submissions anywhere that accepts JSON (Slack, Discord,
# Formspree, a worker). Used only when DATABASE_URL is absent.
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Bearer token required by `HEAD /api/contact` to read the inbox count.
# CONTACT_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# --- GitHub activity ---------------------------------------------------------
# Fine-grained token with read access to public profile data.
# Without it, the graph renders clearly-labelled sample data.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_USERNAME=

# --- Static export only ------------------------------------------------------
# Set automatically by scripts/build-static.mjs; override only when deploying
# to a sub-path manually.
# NEXT_BASE_PATH=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STATIC_MODE=
